{"id":"1537977414","kind":"answer","title":"有没有什么适合高中生的高效复习方法?","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"AnkiX高考","date":"2020-10-22","updated":"2020-10-22","votes":26,"comment_count":2,"minutes":2,"chars":1112,"keywords":["间隔重复","遗忘曲线","长期记忆","检索练习","Anki"],"summary":"既然都问是复习了，那学委叶哥我肯定要来推荐间隔重复了，说到间隔重复，那肯定得提一下 Anki。 先不讲那么多大道理，看看我和其他同学是怎么做的吧： 你想知道如何高考逆袭吗？ 看我用 Anki 从本一线上涨 157 分！ 我的anki高考自救之路 高三Anki用户的一年使用体验 无法被复制的125天anki增分之路 有关高三使用…","question_detail_html":"<p>现在高一，一直在复习方面没有什么好的方法。请教有没有好一些的高效复习方法?</p>","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/319511423/answer/1537977414","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"BuVA4Ndr\">既然都问是复习了，那学委叶哥我肯定要来推荐间隔重复了，说到间隔重复，那肯定得提一下 Anki。</p><p data-pid=\"XB5cD5hL\">先不讲那么多大道理，看看我和其他同学是怎么做的吧：</p><p data-pid=\"av1HOb1n\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/41568928\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">你想知道如何高考逆袭吗？ 看我用 Anki 从本一线上涨 157 分！</a></p><p data-pid=\"FTlnkd9i\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/108313018\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">我的anki高考自救之路</a></p><p data-pid=\"Jj7dNpVD\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/68624891\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">高三Anki用户的一年使用体验</a></p><p data-pid=\"B9tMk1en\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/161332209\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">无法被复制的125天anki增分之路</a></p><p data-pid=\"hqKXBy_h\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/68577838\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">有关高三使用Anki的体验历程和感受</a></p><p data-pid=\"d63BoCGe\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/165108643\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">前2%考生中提升 800 名+？Anki 与我的提分之路</a></p><p data-pid=\"_WDBRqmg\">以上是一些同学的 Anki 使用经验，接下来我简单介绍一下 Anki</p><p data-pid=\"Z5e0u7QE\">Anki 是什么？一款能够<b>自动</b>安排<b>复习</b>的<b>笔记</b>管理软件：</p><figure data-size=\"small\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-c4849c97a51c7b153aea06d07305b5a3_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-e024b77618139e0d826efcd396f24f26\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-503410525cbb1d0b2c644473b5603fe6_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1080\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-c4849c97a51c7b153aea06d07305b5a3_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-e024b77618139e0d826efcd396f24f26\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-503410525cbb1d0b2c644473b5603fe6_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1080\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"CJ7vvSTe\">啥意思呢？大白话就是，你把笔记记到 Anki 里，Anki 就自动帮你安排复习的日期，每一天要复习什么都自动安排好，你复习的时候给个反馈，Anki 就能继续安排下一次复习的日期。跟着 Anki 的安排复习，就能记住 90% 你记入笔记。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-ea31c6e0b385698299984e1a5be77a86_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-f77c9de95c5b7fa7b32d0e1e112dcb40\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-270da3ab5640ebf95710de5054b5263e_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1207\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-ea31c6e0b385698299984e1a5be77a86_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-f77c9de95c5b7fa7b32d0e1e112dcb40\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-270da3ab5640ebf95710de5054b5263e_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1207\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"qTpBzt_r\">神奇吗？一点也不神奇。间隔重复是基于实验统计<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>的规律：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-5be9eee2e64c0710f402bb29d9a5d3ad_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-96286e7cd67adbb0bed5e5b3f72c6519\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-0ab5e75dc4c3124703af19e7681d7412_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1214\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-5be9eee2e64c0710f402bb29d9a5d3ad_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-96286e7cd67adbb0bed5e5b3f72c6519\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-0ab5e75dc4c3124703af19e7681d7412_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1214\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"KP50D00t\">没有间隔重复，学生将在一年后遗忘 33% 的知识，两年后遗忘 50% ！使用间隔重复后，将提高 40% 的学习效率<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>！</p><p data-pid=\"ay3DRjUo\">当然，想要达到这个效果，不是直接开始用 Anki 就能实现的。在使用 Anki 的过程中，你一定会对知识的组织方式大为头疼。</p><p data-pid=\"zbD6RYWf\">为啥？因为 Anki 里的笔记在复习时都是以问题的形式出现的。想要高效复习，必须锻炼自己向知识提问的能力。能够向知识提出一个有意义的问题，才算初步理解了这个知识。同时，测试效应也会在复习过程中给你很大的帮助：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-01d233025fb362b535fbcf66975ebfb8_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-41dd619d66a1e5a8116759604f4d8347\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-d5f6d879b8eac8cd8f74f9079e261783_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1210\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-01d233025fb362b535fbcf66975ebfb8_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-41dd619d66a1e5a8116759604f4d8347\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-d5f6d879b8eac8cd8f74f9079e261783_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1210\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"rRPIfmc6\">一项研究表明，在学过相同材料的两组人中，接受过测试练习的人在 6 个月后的考试上取得的分数相比重新阅读材料的人，高了 13%<sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup></p><p data-pid=\"plGhSj-M\">在 Anki 里，你会制作大量这样的问题卡片：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-6b5fcdbdcadd61e11f60c19f47d71a46_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-0d874ae94464f05f777e5fa84899b640\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-82f20cdb6936d561650763ebfc6995a2_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-6b5fcdbdcadd61e11f60c19f47d71a46_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-0d874ae94464f05f777e5fa84899b640\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-82f20cdb6936d561650763ebfc6995a2_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-2ef700e63e8d22659562b72ff7d4cc89_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-59d6d4464bafe611f125316fedee6a01\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-0e82090cd3d09825aca9151a286de048_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-2ef700e63e8d22659562b72ff7d4cc89_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-59d6d4464bafe611f125316fedee6a01\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-0e82090cd3d09825aca9151a286de048_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-f09121b4ad86353e01b24e0c5d04dc10_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-e53afbc2b6061bb6c4b88276be4bdf66\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-13e5b9e1d76255a690f8989cacf44b68_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"790\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-f09121b4ad86353e01b24e0c5d04dc10_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-e53afbc2b6061bb6c4b88276be4bdf66\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-13e5b9e1d76255a690f8989cacf44b68_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"790\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"EekxMMVk\">我复习过的卡片都无偿分享在这里了，可以参考参考：</p><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-b6546a28845e426a25b971ce7fcab919_ipico.jpg\" data-image-height=\"200\" data-image-width=\"200\" href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/column/c_1273994778548252672\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Anki高考牌组</a><p data-pid=\"yn5NV0Qi\">如果想要学习如何使用 Anki，我写的这篇教程汇总可能能帮到你：</p><p data-pid=\"Cc6gcvSa\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/61564332\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Anki 教程(电子书)与 B 站 Ankidroid 教程(视频)快速通道</a></p><p data-pid=\"H1eQulxn\">如果觉得有用还麻烦多多点赞了，别光收藏，藏着掖着多不好 23333。介绍给同学还能一起制作笔记，一起复习！</p><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 【理论】Study smarter, NOT longer. 你需要间隔重复！ <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"57020308\" href=\"#/post/57020308\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> Spaced repetition <a href=\"https://www.osmosis.org/learn/Spaced_repetition\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.osmosis.org/learn/Spaced_repetition</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> Testing effect <a href=\"https://www.osmosis.org/learn/Testing_effect?playlist=scienceoflearning\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.osmosis.org/learn/Testing_effect?playlist=scienceoflearn…</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"57020308","title":"【理论】Study smarter, NOT longer. 你需要间隔重复！","author":"Osmosis from Elsevier","votes":135,"minutes":3,"reason":"本回答Level 3 引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"57113246","title":"【理论】测试效应——什么？考试有助于我的学习？","author":"Osmosis from Elsevier","votes":105,"minutes":2,"reason":"延伸深读 · Osmosis from Elsevier"},{"id":"46855765","title":"使用Anki准备大型考试的设置","author":"Anki","votes":41,"minutes":7,"reason":"延伸深读 · Anki"},{"id":"46856037","title":"我要去度假。我可以暂停复习程序吗？","author":"Anki","votes":16,"minutes":2,"reason":"延伸深读 · Anki"},{"id":"46533104","title":"疑问:Anki 没有向我展示我的所有卡片！","author":"Anki","votes":12,"minutes":11,"reason":"延伸深读 · Anki"},{"id":"6046109771","title":"如何追赶积压的 Anki 复习任务","author":"Soren Bjornstad","votes":209,"minutes":14,"reason":"延伸深读 · Soren Bjornstad"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"1285507844","title":"高三生物可以速成吗？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":27,"minutes":7,"reason":"相似问答 · 27 赞同"},{"id":"749742933","title":"高三应该如何将三轮复习的效率最大化？理科？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":57,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 57 赞同"},{"id":"1542698928","title":"高三有哪些复习各科的高效学习方法？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":46,"minutes":5,"reason":"相似问答 · 46 赞同"},{"id":"1005545481","title":"有哪些实用学习的APP可以推荐一下？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":66,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 66 赞同"},{"id":"1882739659","title":"Anki 怎么用高效？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":241,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 241 赞同"}]}